WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:12.150
Neils Bohr was a pioneer of the structure
of atom, he was from Denmark and he was given

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:20.700
(as far as I understand) he was given a house
by the brewery the Carlsberg brewery which

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:26.140
was next door to the brewery and it had a
tap in the wall which he could open and lager

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:35.719
would come out and it is quite an interesting
fact that during the second world war, that

00:00:35.719 --> 00:00:44.179
Otto Hahn and Max Planck, two German Nobel
Prize winners gave Niels Bohr their Nobel

00:00:44.179 --> 00:00:51.100
Prizes, gold medals to look after and when
Germany invaded Denmark, he was not quite

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:59.440
sure what he should do so his colleagues dissolved
gold in aqua regia which is a mixture of hydrochloric

00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:06.340
and nitric acid, the only material that will
dissolve up gold and just left these beakers

00:01:06.340 --> 00:01:11.120
of solution on the shelf and nobody realised
that it was gold and after the war the gold

00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:15.540
was recovered and the Nobel prizes were given
back to their winners.

